  <title>Differential Equations: Laws Written as Derivatives</title>
  <shorttitle>Differential Equations</shorttitle>

  <introduction><p>A differential equation specifies a relation involving an unknown function and its derivatives. Initial conditions specify the starting values. We will formulate rate models, solve several important equation types, and use direction fields and numerical methods when an explicit solution is unavailable.</p></introduction>

